<title>FRANCE: CGIP 1996 sales rise.</title>
<headline>CGIP 1996 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 1,785    vs    1,636</p>
<p>NOTE - CGIP said in the Balo official bulletin that the 1995 figures were retreated to reflect the sale of its CarnaudMetal box stake.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
